1
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:15,000
Climbing on coconut row by river. Monkey sees Crocodile crying. Monkey asks:

2
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:19,550
Why are you crying?

3
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:25,520
I cry because no one plays with me.

4
00:00:25,970 --> 00:00:31,820
Hearing that, Monkey invites Crocodile to be friends.

5
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:41,600
From then, every day Crocodile comes, eats fruits Monkey picks.

6
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:49,320
One day, Crocodile invites Monkey to play at his house.

7
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:58,870
Monkey agrees, sits on Crocodile's back.

8
00:00:58,870 --> 00:01:07,020
Swimming far from shore, Crocodile says:

9
00:01:07,020 --> 00:01:16,070
Our king is seriously ill, must eat a monkey heart to recover.

10
00:01:16,070 --> 00:01:21,670
I need your heart.

11
00:01:21,770 --> 00:01:27,370
Monkey stays calm, says:

12
00:01:27,820 --> 00:01:37,770
My heart is left at home. Quickly take me back to bring to your king.

13
00:01:37,770 --> 00:01:45,420
Crocodile believes, immediately brings Monkey back to shore.

14
00:01:45,420 --> 00:01:53,150
Arriving there, Monkey jumps to tree branch, says:

15
00:01:53,150 --> 00:01:57,720
You are really treacherous!

16
00:01:57,720 --> 00:02:03,470
No one wants to be friends with you!

17
00:02:03,470 --> 00:02:10,420
Crocodile quickly dives deep into water, disappears.

